# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit the real value.
#
# Discord incoming webhook URL used by scripts/brief.sh to post the weekly
# briefing. Get it from the channel: Edit Channel → Integrations → Webhooks.
# For automated runs, this same value is stored as the `DISCORD_BRIEFING_WEBHOOK`
# Actions secret on the GitHub repo.
DISCORD_BRIEFING_WEBHOOK=
